  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When you are in safety mode with the ghosted blocked avatars it would be nice to have a range adjuster of how far away your computers will load avatars for you. Set to 0 it will only be friends avatars, set to 10 and you will be able to see anyones avatars within a 10 foot radius of yourself. Lower to 5 to be 5 feet, etc.\nId love to see peoples avatars, and a radius range would allow a limited number of avatars to load as long as they are in range. Once out of range they revert to the ghosted avatars. It would save on lag perhaps while still allowing us to see some avatars outside of friends list.",
